{
  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8ba64b2949ab15100debd314ef923c4856d1f3781975cc29ab8953666c2ec32f2d7e2694fe435a5cc99502025a78a05cd6de7a743ad26095bfd68dde7d4111ce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/92e90d9bc887cc3f7f7a122e861940dbe622ffb73c03303f1b382ee08acbb51804b2c82425720afdd3683d5cdedbb48d235874ea6922f7baea766c255efaa9b84e3a3a9e4d9f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f32177cb0b3083c79566e80c8d7d4c386a3fb5ec06cdf10389d7110e079c9c28f23890f714c5a5ba8c18f588fba01ac77a2832c92c7167e6e84615304219ef67b299461c590e3f7975a6a152da9a8b886a8a1fc16cb7c151c289fb0b2dbdf4a4366e46b29efa8ae7e48804e8e467e474a3a1636a4dcd0e80\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4c6124f82bea2ba5f0f3111e2508ac0fcc185e5a7607e5b29a96f2b3181875e61cf7c34ad5292e6ec8f4ad2f0e6838bc81b1a3ca9a3edf6ab69f01eebd34fa6f777db8947640a1d81a6e84eb1c741f47bab3d2eb1d47aa2728bc845dfdbb2d9835598b33b6b786fdc79ee97fe2eea9055cab7b58206d28b2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ea68667da8625a06b9b7cb486829572dd0b41e61319b8352e0d4eeb966d56769cf83d0476f0bbaa1861b7442d9e47ff22509b8781143a3a2941cee6d766d5440c79b17f24b070c9a608c898dacd731db250b4837118b134cbc04fd176c1cf45296ca80b0145c58e2936cb3a339c0c93273747ec50031c911\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6c168e35820011c2b3d97b57437d0a2f0b9898a27c30c252fd2c2e6926bb26f52c796c4a9ce399fb3cb5d4af61fd282d163fdf36ffd1f442207d7f227156ca17460393e434a32f9e32f14c89992e8b9cb3c92a093150d31076816c35965311abd106178dc532f781da4eee0f4fecb40c56521a983d91278c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/961cf7b96142d79823497d583a782c8b83bc46f8bf05c365abf4130e5ce6ad8963e04699e687f2a590cd06f04be7d4bdddb84f2b271f0571a1c425ee912913a8f1e74b47b911b49d6daeaf2c8dc0f8a5f5172d84f5d68832e1e824cfdbaa17336da63626696318ab8c21aebfe1fc8ffe460574a929f01593\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d0c9b600824526ca711cec6dcf2a9db98b94b5d6350f77ef555c3df1084a2b880989fc9f33a67c6a64707d7664118498e2fd4c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2a1e8df6216531b37270cc9b9ae074171886b1862bf1e50277c2836efaf84ddf44b04dc270962e5c80edd2dcf38c1ba98748789a46dca9c26eeab78d2c8b7de4331606b6e5e17c1a008d6a848809d7c259e59d08e28b82cdfe27078c757b17ff5d37202de807f3da01b1ad53754a15fa41b7fab9559bdbf3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cc1c8a2ccaba1cc3a04902cc2de8a924e6618bd09f1e612ae53de996d0adc976bfaeb5f8abbcc4bba1a374679ad7096e22f8c3a13b139923370fe46e1b2cd278dae2a9782097ac003cbb11c262b87ba0180b3cfe77b6f99c072a2adeb09a23754f9170a279c613ecde5331ef4361dd7569a5ce8b25c41dff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ae2384cec44b3a6a2cad3c877c64aa8719fce0c33fc160bed249beb81cfcaf2967c699fb8379e0de0a6032c08f322ba3c47d1de2f3d337b4395d7953c4ddd80edd89f8e143fde67f4ab0af966620118c14bd6f4bff20a3b9f6386b2a4e3100b49235185bcb9b33b9532509096d07dbf21413f079cd62b733\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/40a024ffc680dc687d1e9438d564c380e849a2869f8579cf133c2720eebeffd45110d20068f4a753b9dc1c763764c434b82d7c320e253d2b20673201024257d196325924db358521d985dcc4f0f78d1919f82c6582e0f47c7239cab076c24f30eaa06bf59d053540a4db8ab3a98a5e4f0db3eca2b380207a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/af6067ad8cc1d14e2a3da2fc83ef67010976f4d87640c94576b560220e33a6ec165200acb0b3fa35e1318ff506c34e4e6e8e6aa3e33f90df8040ded1707dad22bf17176963859f782bd945b40fc64ff0648e94f22289953b2eba26b50daa46aaa62e3e9636cb83d5d0c54123d7994fe9d118f702a810b726\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/852ed878b7f58ad9d5f498bdb3bc52e08f762b452c4ecd49be966bf795fc412437e59081c441d206ebf8c56bdad71c1fa0279ac948ba25c776f48c92ff5903b6860283d71cbf95cd5977aef856fc29f65ce91ec0bcc4542be6c43c4ff04b1ec09a0dd6083064d909d0785544d5cb7ad955f3820a0e7973bb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/d383a3a493c5d256061c220effcade54004496d4c17fbc0a9abb7637fafedf2c10fcfed617e2164ecf2873dd464e990dce221b31594c85e9e683d7d41106e1e4a464084e72ddb48fd7c9564599f57b8f25270fd56f56f3cb11db0f5d5ef4ec2e2500c9bfd1f0d9e46eed1e653d29ee7447294e2898c438e7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/748df0bd9564d80e3ccb5f42d151eafd907f2fb702e961f13199f66d9e30159c564c2759358e34088fd0422c36591a04076f8713b9132745ecee4c28a6f0c1c21565378ca609d66697e4c6423eb72e2efb0063323c82830fba35ec1a92b64d4e99390f832bee16f7ba7baf89af2fcdafeed6b420353d971b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9eba7ed73b9555758fd29e6b45bd4d5381566e86f3fb5c36bca66c3e3a25e39121d1fa6870e880ef1e7e99909c6e51a76f6a998b8f09ded7ac6ae7dc6fdc757cfaa9979c3b71d88cd38da898b13343a0900230e975c3f9f3620e5e915aa99b46987ca0481100113cece559797065229032b8f1eca1b4f3cd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/409a387d7de36a38f609e7641c3639820a24e6873577e569c4f1f0ceb4105dcb93d5bf0a15783269daadfbc20115811da035d1457ee2b4beff7fc06cdf787cf719e4cd868aa432c6f67799b1cc14ab46fd7a51481f1191b78eefb26cf9ccae931874162ef9fed76dde22fd1afa47b0114e66a705ad09d92f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/def55596fe880ece8c5d0a59195ee64cd1f6ba76a2fe9d44f5ab0e8a7c966d3a512d8e69a3ab879d01cbef0365703ff1918d5b817e35fec07567d831936bab4554121797bab8de4637bb9fca2d74468eafdfbcddf4104c0cedb15c5c1257b8aafa71fb01a0b696f18ab35673a38d112ba978a13e422be1cf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/df77ddaf22d8362b41e9b719bf0991ddff37a857c83234724c6b095d61af3d5f05f48e8f92d3259fa2e7f02c4a8d506cb489eb725ef6ec363c91b1e44cd3e5e0e0b8cf1e96cde8678fb661241844ded33c75e592a827ea680fdb0e5a4576d8677688d749fe97cca09dcf9f3fb44bc151361f5d1575c08a40\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/19dce5f153fac1eade59649800e699ca584c1d2a5d6a4bf087400d3567cc6110ff6a70797cf7552d3187924f81d7536c982bf1eed9ae261d12408ecacd6d274075baa72b8176b85e76fee8525cafa4ddc7f85c7c8c588862b2398f84a65d3cfc80cc14abd1829771d11e22cd991e6819d6f480414114274d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fdae958cc54cfb2997a05341975be87c2d617d2a848fc6dba5a6a9c06ae034cfd54fac2ada779ab4f8e16f70da5b87ce99c1ea9c68a8eb46d0f5513189a55c2771cbb2fd229ea7d549d6630f088d40a0b67e6d1137f59ff927dfeaf76c8b28ed9c3e65e78eb91d569ddd73d604a8f452c0edd56c85827221\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c340700b83f5d7bf21c383a37c489a89e7a40f0dc7b24367ffe000d506310ea870dd7496114648cbee811aac8763556e2ad0015c31c938e71576de89757d45b4463a8fa0a596f285b521fc12926adc1b1a25bb29fe203c868fd1c06b2f1eec0b274a384be41e3330a24e9a9ff537b3f484ef7402512acd4e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2c0ac2cfc94321a5a1e1ee9af9f389987474631470c549abf2f0f128e6938216f53459e80f84286c3d4736fddd4a097badebcbe53f75fd3fdfe64e39cd457bdcc41914c29fd61dd2986679669d94ea25906f220acd35c3ed34bfbff3a53421b45e4fb255bfe0ae75744b85c43b5419655ac188f4311ebddd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/045f6c759e36cf74438506b5ab556f5fb0e8744daeb134622b0a4c7e924143432ea91041fb2b2bd2f7f6d74a1539f2a7d1e0f02e0b94ac7c118bdf646e36b6703470beb41a9dbb652762c9478161a819f5ac55fbd23d7cfeb597b86eaab320131b49592b7005110d86fc55016ef1c1e71b540c65cc8a9cc2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/89de5752b1a9085c57209f4ad3e94f246a08e85c3ee9bf2a510a80a819fc7e12fc4af2c36fd38e56e480f804fa76a566c222ea24d02045afa8a50ad34bd35e596f6f65e87ef3a49ea2db7a28d323b08f3d58e6b03604ce776de842ef41ee258bfe863a8d063d54802f02fa8a545251e61158574051bded1c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b408c61b8d2abbae5cb4b1624e8f664dbaf0fe213089c3b5d9154dc3265b9bb845d59e13f481d2a9e78948e615328393a1ed39b30f3af4ee25ae37d7cb341f2206cce1de1a8f9a87bb40cfb5638bb932f5521dba0e9a05e67b288fabc7b30a41909177284efab4eb36c29bbd6f849e490cb826f8bcebcec4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/a105dd15b888a33e3afb5c70f3e12925d58145c95c7bbab2d3145474bad72cab6438f32e358700bcd172306e9a40a5f39cc1448f1fa9019e517c1e5f86a6e8e258a2aad058199784f1aa8db0cfb2f9b464be3a45683da73e06bc5e\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/acaeb57e6d8cbe280f212a2657484b9ebe9da4fd9b74aa07d4832e791937c64f6bd5886aecd996c0000e79597e8db4b583c59f474b8b753b35a2d9ae6453e50ca4c43ecb26d6ada720443889941284ea6433bd9cfda59837cc9a0d8af6c384059876de81bbe94bd410c75de44573cd05afe342fed5fb16fc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/820addabe4f4c67e82a6f7a744754eda1ab26c72f870961e35c773ca6ca5e1c5d912f4315db6979339215d3ed4e3d9ecc1ca9105621ace330935c56eb9cef6f430a5b1ad2dca41fcdfae1663da8273dec2cb96942960ae9c2aa270a66636f89eb575475906af1a3af3cae1785033d32149ec1a1a13c743da\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/51a32fa5d9eabaee17db4d0e8f7bd3dd1fda63ee406c903eee45429ba8c7bff961f8bf4a4f06fc5882dc82a426d33c8610d8d9728010eb78110178b802166943156467b86305222e187966ec2b79a35608695d3daf4557a35c45d09b71bae5cea4e93d13715c312a30a177480d1a2252a36ffe3814ed52c1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/90a590b52dba50957fc5282679aea106387fc366bdda81af2aa4254eaf0d1c789ac748b7eb2d737974562dd1e8fd745912adc5c94fbcadbc48b82cff4c547d947f6f8292179455819956005fd4782600f85e59a20f829db0ef4279da1ca45c8742d7f1be9a9c3cac25c7ae8c3a95fcbe352e581e8fbca24c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/853357e4bebe128a343d5801993c39f01bfcdee77d14baf78a4d2c109bf552a9a8ed10e2d8743f313d01b5a05a971952ee07e55d187844d3227692db057eb9d4707b065b1ab5ce95cd67674dd3ccc22e217d73514e3c242c27a7b8b283fb82681b6a9d6a87b9d590cf8aa1a42cce77a65ad1e3c7a9701105\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/9daf4fb21d12825f7785bf5de36dfe1f1f345182233c641ab54bd55718bca39a7f8920170de91bc20967c3f0ce81f8baec5df85822fe160473f565ec6fa386083a7e17e01729ec172403eeca91a4bc8619e7d2ff2835bfa4b5421fded76aac1561e58b8863d427ec5fce202851267b841a1f5cb067968f14\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/6a44a94effd7a9eaaeee5b3ef56f43ef1e6b276c0dd28b6eac668f4a4cb289018f8e2875645905c33ad591d242f2829ed8970e9c340ecb7bc222f8a71add04605354fd4b9fc58c61700dfa94556d5b3d087579ca4694425c9b19e0403bb93827b9ae4f1a810bb0d4375b417f8a7c0918d3dae626491446b0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
